{"3646700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battles For Glory", "steam_appid": 3646700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles For Glory </strong>is a classic<strong> MMORPG RvR g</strong>ame where faction-versus-faction conflict and world map control are combined. From early morning until late evening, there are sieges and defenses of outposts, cities, castles, and fortresses, as well as battles for territories, bosses, artifacts, and numerous events. This is a world where magic and steel reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/9db6731f514a93c12448aaf63047dca4.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/9db6731f514a93c12448aaf63047dca4.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/9db6731f514a93c12448aaf63047dca4.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRE-ALPHA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles For Glory is currently in active development. Core gameplay systems are continuously being built, tested, and improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an early-stage project, the game is regularly updated and continuously evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/6581f5aeaff12856ce506db007843351.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/6581f5aeaff12856ce506db007843351.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/6581f5aeaff12856ce506db007843351.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sieges and PvP Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sieges of outposts, castles, and cities form the core of the gameplay. Take part in large-scale battles where every decision you make can influence the fate of your faction and its influence in the world. Join PvP battles, fight other players, develop your clan, and lead it to power and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/f9021c7c27d903ef39f9045b437b64b0.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/f9021c7c27d903ef39f9045b437b64b0.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/f9021c7c27d903ef39f9045b437b64b0.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vast open world of Battles For Glory, where every corner hides new opportunities, mysteries, and dangers! There are no restrictions - you are free to explore, fight, and achieve greatness in the world in any way you see fit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/ae1c495b5d9aa223d3baaad54231c713.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/ae1c495b5d9aa223d3baaad54231c713.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/ae1c495b5d9aa223d3baaad54231c713.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Bosses and Rare Rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Battles For Glory, world bosses can be encountered - powerful creatures guarding unique rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to obtain rare and valuable items capable of changing the course of war and giving your side a strategic advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1b20262417af65dd77687731fa467c58.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1b20262417af65dd77687731fa467c58.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1b20262417af65dd77687731fa467c58.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Conflict</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each side has unique abilities, goals, and strategies. In Battles For Glory, there are no neutral sides - all are engaged in an endless war for control over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a hero defending your lands, or a conqueror seeking world domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1643d8218b788399e281b4af6114e1a9.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1643d8218b788399e281b4af6114e1a9.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/1643d8218b788399e281b4af6114e1a9.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership and Archons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>n Battles For Glory, each faction is led by a leader chosen by all players. The leader makes strategic decisions and commands the army in decisive battles, while Archons assist with management and siege planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the course of war is shaped not only by leaders and Archons - every player, regardless of their role, can influence events and the outcome of battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/619dbf51188414e71e99d79413e946d0.poster.avif?t=1780662954\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/619dbf51188414e71e99d79413e946d0.webm?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646700/extras/619dbf51188414e71e99d79413e946d0.mp4?t=1780662954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles For Glory </strong>is a classic<strong> MMORPG RvR g<